OL,3,AUS approves sale of 500 Patriot
OL,4,Amissiles to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas repeatedly urged the US to speed up
OL,8,Fdeliveries of its Patriots - the only
OL,9,Feffective weapon in downing Russia's
OL,10,Fdeadly ballistic missiles.
OL,12,FThe latest move comes just days after a
OL,13,Frow between Zelensky and Donald Trump,
OL,14,Fwith the US president saying it was
OL,15,Ftime for Ukraine to get a new leader to
OL,16,Ftry to end the war with Russia.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
